Make PositionRestraintCommTest.PositionRestraintsTwoCOMs deterministic.

Backport of upstream GROMACS merge request 6396,
"testing: make PositionRestraintsTwoCOMs more deterministic":
https://gitlab.com/gromacs/gromacs/-/merge_requests/6396
merged into main as squash commit 4c1faccef1487d79b8c0ae19acca655560d486b4
(not in v2026.3, v2026.4 or release-2026).
The diff below is https://gitlab.com/gromacs/gromacs/-/merge_requests/6396.diff
unmodified: ld-seed = 4, relative tolerance 5e-4 in both precisions, and the
matching reference data.
Drop this patch once the GROMACS release in use contains that commit.

